# a1-inventor authoring

Standing repo law: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). Keep agent policy out of generated site pages and lesson chrome.

## Open course

- Public curriculum lives under `course/`. Anyone may read everything there.
- Do **not** reintroduce instructor-only or spoiler-gated trees.
- Student agent packs: `course/agents/` (build-ignored). Cursor config is `AGENTS.md` / `.cursor/rules/` only.

## Weeks

- Spine is **weeks 1–15**. Permalinks `/weeks/NN/`.
- Week frontmatter: `title`, `shortTitle`, `week`, `time`, `goal` (quote `goal` when it contains `:`).
- Full weeks: framing paragraph + topic H2s + `## Done when` + `Next:` link.
- Stubs: `**Status:** stub`, `## Steps`, `## Done when`, `Next:` link.
- Weeks sidebar (`week-nav.njk`): `<ol>` markers only — link text is `shortTitle`, not `N. shortTitle`.

## Site

- Eleventy from `course/**/*.md`; pathPrefix `/a1-inventor/`.
- Keep the reading-first light theme shared with almost-open / hub.
- Do not hand-mirror lessons into HTML.
- Gate demo under `site/lab/`; hub redirects to the course Pages URL.

## Adding or editing a week

1. Edit `course/weeks/NN-slug.md` with the frontmatter contract above.
2. Link it from `course/index.md` and `course/weeks/index.md`.
3. Keep `workflow/` gate contracts in sync when week → gate mapping changes.
